thine own!␀Dost thou kill
non-evil
creatures?␀That does not
show compassion!␀Good.␀GUAR␀COMP␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀a child␀He␀A small child␀I am learning
compassion.␀O.K.␀The solution to
ones problems
often lies in
solving others!␀Never care so
much for thyself
that thou cannot
care for others!␀Know ye the
mantra of
compassion?␀Good.␀Ask Cricket!␀LEAR␀COMP␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Shalimar␀He␀A tired shepherd␀I watch over
the children.␀Good.␀It takes a
good deal of
compassion to
deal with
children!␀Compassion
strengthens the
soul as
knowledge
tempers the
