fighter!␀I search the
dungeons!␀Poor.␀I fell in
the dungeon
'Destard'.␀Therein use the
stones found in
the connecting
dungeons!␀Hast thou found
its altar room?␀It connects with
Covetous, Shame
and Hythloth!␀Find it!␀DUNG␀ROOM␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Sir William␀He␀A noble fighter.␀I search
for valiant
fighters!␀Very well.␀Kill not
non-evil
creatures but
still always
stand thy
ground!␀Let them flee
instead.
never
flee uninjured!␀Art thou
valiant?␀Strive ye to
defeat all evil!␀I see.␀EVIL␀KILL␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Sir Hrothgar␀He␀A mighty
warrior!␀I fight for
