warrior.␀I fight battles!␀Only minor
wounds!␀True valor is
seen not in the
force of arms,
but in the force
of will!␀I display my
valor in battle.␀Art thou
valiant?␀Then never flee
unless the need
is dire!␀Coward.␀BATT␀VALO␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Timrod␀He␀A thin fighter.␀I fight
with valor!␀Couldn't be
better!␀There is no
holier spot of
ground than
where defeated
valor lies.␀Be brave for
there is much
to dare!␀Art thou brave?␀Fortune helps
