inner light.␀I am well.␀I seek the "one
great truth"!␀That which
lies within
the codex!␀Dost thou seek
this "truth"?␀Some things take
forever but
brick by brick
mountains can be
built!␀Alas.␀LIGH␀TRUT␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Emerson␀He␀An injured man.␀I seek the
spiritual path.␀I am grievously
wounded.␀Spiritual is
stronger than
any material
force.␀Nothing can
bring thee peace
but the triumph
of principles!␀Art thou good
in spirit?␀A good path.␀An evil path!␀SPIR␀WOUN␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Santayana␀He␀A tall ranger.␀I carry the
light within my
heart.␀I am alive.␀The light of
philosophy.␀In philosophical
minds the
familiar excites
wonder!␀Dost thou always
tread the right
path?␀Doubtful!␀Few can, but
strive to do so!␀LIGH␀PHIL␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Presto␀He␀A very small
wizard.␀I cast great
big spells!␀Superior!␀I can cast:
jinx, kill,
and view!␀Yes, ask the
barkeep at
'The Axe-n-Ale'
in Vesper about
nightshade.␀Dost thou know
what these
spells have in
common?␀What?␀Guess!␀SPEL␀NIGH␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Granted␀She␀A hungry beggar.␀I beg for food
and money.␀I am not
at all well.␀To eat!␀To buy food!␀Wilt thou give
me food or
money?␀In return I will
tell thee that
the ankh knows
of the rune and
my friend Ambule
knows the
mantra!␀Jerk!␀FOOD␀MONE␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Mitre␀She␀A radiant
ranger.␀I am reading the
wizard's journal.␀I am fine.␀It tells of the
white stone.␀It is no longer
in the dungeon
Hythloth, it
is gone!␀Wilt thou try to
recover it?␀Ask of the stone
at the Tap in
Trinsic!␀Too bad.␀JOUR␀STON␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Buddha␀He␀A great
philosopher.␀I teach.␀I am well.␀When one has
pity on all
living creatures
then is one
noble.␀If one speaks or
acts with pure
thought,
happiness will
follow like a
shadow that
never leaves.␀A␀A␀A␀TEAC␀NOBL␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Michaelangelo␀He␀A skilled ranger␀I strive along
the path.␀Well.␀Success is a
journey, not a
destination.␀May thou always
desire more than
thou can
accomplish!␀Art thou far
along the path?␀This is good.␀Fear not thou
shalt be.␀PATH␀JOUR␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Romasco␀He␀A short dumpy
