impressive.␀Strive to be as
such.␀HONO␀DIGN␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Terrin␀He␀A cowering child␀I ran from
