the guild shop.␀I know the world
is round!␀Been to the
guild shop?␀Great selection!␀Best prices!␀TINK␀TRAV␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Balthasar␀He␀A sturdy
peasant.␀I am a serf.␀I'm pooped.␀Serfs work hard
for little pay!␀I work the
fields for my
master!␀Dost thou have
a master?␀I hope he or she
is a kind one!␀Thou art lucky
indeed!␀SERF␀WORK␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Plain␀He␀A small man.␀I seek humility.␀I am
fully healed.␀When the 3
principles of
virtue combine
in eight ways
pride has no
virtue!␀To be proud is
not a virtue,
and so Magincia
was destroyed!
Humility is the
virtue that
remains!␀A␀A␀A␀HUMI␀PRID␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Simple␀She␀A slender
shepherdess.␀I seek the
shrine.␀I am fine.␀The shrine
of humility!␀The shrine lies
on the north
bank of the isle
of the abyss and
is guarded by
endless hoards
of daemons!␀Know the isle?␀Good.␀Southeast of
Britannia!␀SHRI␀HUMI␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Gem␀She␀A fair woman.␀I do humble
works.␀I am doing well.␀I can help thee
with the mantra!␀Since humility
is the opposite
of pride, so is
its mantra!␀Know ye the
mantra of pride?␀Then reverse it
for humility!␀When thou dost,
reverse it!␀WORK␀MANT␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Joseph␀He␀A wise shepherd.␀I am but a
humble shepherd.␀I am well.␀I am on a
pilgrimage unto
the shrine of
humility!␀It is on the
dark island!␀Did thou know
that there is no
shrine of pride?␀Very good.␀Pride is not a
virtue of the
avatar!␀SHEP␀SHRI␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Friday␀She␀A beautiful
and impressive
guard.␀I shall warn
thee against
taking this
gold!␀I am well
enough!␀It is not thine!␀It is not thine!␀Dost thou intend
to take it?␀That would not
reflect well
upon thy
virtues!␀That is good.␀GOLD␀WARN␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Randal␀He␀A solemn ranger.␀I teach of
the shrines.␀I am well.␀One >must< visit
each shrine for
1, 2 & 3 cycles
each for thy
paths to be
clear!␀A␀Dost thou visit
them often?␀Very good.␀Make that the
first goal along
thy path to
avatarhood!␀SHRI␀A   ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Dirgen␀He␀A wise man.␀I give wise
counsel.␀Well.␀Strive ye to
know and
develop the
virtue within
thee.␀The Seer
Hawkwind should
be consulted
>often< for he
can see within
thee!␀Dost thou?␀Good!␀Thou shalt
surely stray
from the path!␀COUN␀VIRT␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Shazbot␀She␀A funny jester.␀Thou thinks
I'm funny!␀I've a
slight tickle!␀I dare thee to
ask me about
Nate the snake!␀Well, it's a
long story and
we haven't the
time.␀Don't thou?␀Well good, I
try to be!␀Ah, too bad, I
thought I was.␀FUNN␀NATE␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Flatbush␀He␀A slender youth.␀I am an
apprentice mage!␀I am very
powerful!␀I am the
Calumny's
favorite!␀He lives in Yew!␀Hast thou
been to Yew?␀Calumny knows
the quickness
spell!␀Calumny knows
the quickness
spell! Seek
him out!␀MAGE␀CALU␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Corkrin␀He␀A bold paladin.␀I travel these
fair lands to
spread the
virtues!␀I am fully
healed!␀To know thy
progress on the
paths of virtue
one >must< visit
the Seer
Hawkwind often!␀A␀Dost thou
do this?␀Good.␀Thou must or
thou may stray!␀VIRT␀A   ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Dyka␀He␀A tall
nimble man.␀I am a thief, I
like to borrow!␀I am very well!␀My favorite
things to borrow
are horses!␀You can steal
horses in the
towne Paws!␀Art thou
a thief?␀Watch out for
the bull in the
corral!␀Likely, thou
art a wimp!␀BORR␀HORS␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀999999999999999999|udrodq{9999999>>>>>>>>>>99999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>999>>>>>>>>>>>>99>>>>>>>>>>999>>>>>>>>>>999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>99>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>99>>>>>0>>>>0>>>>>99>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>99>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>9>>>>>>>>>>0>>>>0>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>9>>>>>>99>>>>>>>>99>>>>>>>>99>>>>>;>>`qlr>>>>>>>99>>>>>>>>>>>>>rkddo99z`kdz>>>>>>>>>999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>;>>>>>999<>>>>>>>zz99>I>>>>>>>I>><<999>zfthkcz><<<999>>>>>>>><<<<999999999999999999999999999999999␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀É+ZW.-Q....S).RSSSPQPPáâ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀		␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	
